\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}&\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}} \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi} \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi} \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "cc8aa811-99e1-5f7b-aa43-885740447191" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "cc8aa811-99e1-5f7b-aa43-885740447191" :question/answer-fields "ae68e617-0d18-59ff-b276-92bb3877ffb1"] [:db/ensure "cc8aa811-99e1-5f7b-aa43-885740447191" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "cc8aa811-99e1-5f7b-aa43-885740447191"] [:db/add "329a4cb4-a769-5de9-aacc-d3079ac1112e" :answer/id #uuid "329a4cb4-a769-5de9-aacc-d3079ac1112e"] [:db/add "329a4cb4-a769-5de9-aacc-d3079ac1112e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "329a4cb4-a769-5de9-aacc-d3079ac1112e" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db/ensure "329a4cb4-a769-5de9-aacc-d3079ac1112e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0d7b3916-d16a-55a0-887c-9707e9a294ca" :answer/id #uuid "0d7b3916-d16a-55a0-887c-9707e9a294ca"] [:db/add "0d7b3916-d16a-55a0-887c-9707e9a294ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0d7b3916-d16a-55a0-887c-9707e9a294ca" :answer/value "\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db/ensure "0d7b3916-d16a-55a0-887c-9707e9a294ca" :answer/validate] [:db/add "a8d12b77-3bc8-5510-bf0f-5292e1c94647" :answer/id #uuid "a8d12b77-3bc8-5510-bf0f-5292e1c94647"] [:db/add "a8d12b77-3bc8-5510-bf0f-5292e1c94647" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a8d12b77-3bc8-5510-bf0f-5292e1c94647" :answer/value "\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\