[:db/ensure "364c4cf3-af52-5e60-b60f-daba0a790be0" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "364c4cf3-af52-5e60-b60f-daba0a790be0"] [:db/add "b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f" :answer/id #uuid "b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f"] [:db/add "b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f" :answer/value "- \\frac{2}{3}"] [:db/ensure "b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0" :answer-field/id #uuid "dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0"] [:db/add "dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0" :answer-field/choices "b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f"] [:db/add "dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0" :answer-field/correct "b8772597-72e4-58b4-b2a1-6f679b96ed8f"] [:db/ensure "dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe" :question/id #uuid "25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe"] [:db/add "25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} 2 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sin{\\left(\\pi \\right)}=0,\\quad \\sin{\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{2} \\right)}=-1$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{3}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\pi\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{3}}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} 2 \\cos{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\pi}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}} \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{2 \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{\\pi}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}=\\left(- \\frac{2}{3}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n- \\frac{2}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe" :question/answer-fields "dcd96290-8241-5bb2-b355-d84f90a808e0"] [:db/ensure "25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "25bced4a-34ed-5c44-b898-2a6f8e96effe"] [:db/add "021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678" :answer/id #uuid "021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678"] [:db/add "021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678" :answer/value "- \\frac{4}{3}"] [:db/ensure "021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678" :answer/validate] [:db/add "30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c" :answer-field/id #uuid "30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c"] [:db/add "30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c" :answer-field/choices "021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678"] [:db/add "30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c" :answer-field/correct "021af31d-9874-5ae8-a272-4821d0e63678"] [:db/ensure "30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898" :question/id #uuid "50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898"] [:db/add "50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}} 4 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cos{\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{2} \\right)}=0,\\quad \\cos{\\left(2 \\pi \\right)}=1$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}&\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\pi\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}} 4 \\sin{\\left(3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi} \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\frac{4 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}^{2 \\pi}=\\left(- \\frac{4}{3}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n- \\frac{4}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898" :question/answer-fields "30b9da8d-548f-5899-b955-bc31acebc31c"] [:db/ensure "50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "50022ab1-a0ca-57a9-87be-133525d6d898"] [:db/add "3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7" :answer/id #uuid "3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7"] [:db/add "3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7" :answer/value "\\frac{\\sin{\\left(3 x + 2 \\right)}}{3}"] [:db/ensure "3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8" :answer-field/id #uuid "aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8"] [:db/add "aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8" :answer-field/choices "3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7"] [:db/add "aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8" :answer-field/correct "3b2130aa-7e91-5e77-ad7e-0a4dadbf02b7"] [:db/ensure "aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120" :question/id #uuid "6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120"] [:db/add "6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int \\cos{\\left(3 x + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=3 x + 2$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=3.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int \\cos{\\left(3 x + 2 \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\frac{\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\sin{\\left(3 x + 2 \\right)}}{3}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120" :question/answer-fields "aba90ca0-400c-5f66-bb8d-ad32c6b1fcb8"] [:db/ensure "6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "6ea83d61-8ef7-5554-9089-4e7d6658d120"] [:db/add "74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9" :answer/id #uuid "74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9"] [:db/add "74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9" :answer/value "- \\frac{4}{3}"] [:db/ensure "74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9" :answer/validate] [:db/add "334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034" :answer-field/id #uuid "334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034"] [:db/add "334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034" :answer-field/choices "74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9"] [:db/add "334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034" :answer-field/correct "74c24471-9d9e-52c9-9422-32e366c0f2a9"] [:db/ensure "334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7" :question/id #uuid "cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7"] [:db/add "cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 4 \\sin{\\left(- 3 x + 2 \\pi \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cos{\\left(2 \\pi \\right)}=1,\\quad \\cos{\\left(\\frac{3 \\pi}{2} \\right)}=0$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 3 x + 2 \\pi$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=2 \\pi\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{6}} 4 \\sin{\\left(- 3 x + 2 \\pi \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{4}{3}\\left(\\int_{2 \\pi}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}} \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{4 \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{3}\\right]_{2 \\pi}^{\\frac{3 \\pi}{2}}=\\left(0\\right)-\\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n- \\frac{4}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7" :question/answer-fields "334999f2-0ee1-5d2c-a8b2-9f1cd538e034"] [:db/ensure "cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "cce7215f-f09f-5bb0-8216-21c5515d0db7"] [:db/add "2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594" :answer/id #uuid "2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594"] [:db/add "2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594" :answer/value "- \\sin{\\left(1 - 4 x \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872" :answer-field/id #uuid "7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872"] [:db/add "7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872" :answer-field/choices "2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594"] [:db/add "7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872" :answer-field/correct "2bd2ef87-461c-54e9-9cd4-436889993594"] [:db/ensure "7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd" :question/id #uuid "04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd"] [:db/add "04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 4 \\cos{\\left(1 - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=1 - 4 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 4 \\cos{\\left(1 - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-\\left(\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=- \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n- \\sin{\\left(1 - 4 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd" :question/answer-fields "7662edc2-84aa-5b07-a675-80237a70e872"] [:db/ensure "04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "04ed37b0-08bb-53bf-b3a9-2a83ea7f67cd"] [:db/add "6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6" :answer/id #uuid "6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6"] [:db/add "6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6" :answer/value "\\cos{\\left(2 - 3 x \\right)}"] [:db/ensure "6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51" :answer-field/id #uuid "80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51"] [:db/add "80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51" :answer-field/choices "6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6"] [:db/add "80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51" :answer-field/correct "6ae91d07-3efa-5396-90bc-0c41330a98d6"] [:db/ensure "80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c" :question/id #uuid "7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c"] [:db/add "7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c" :question/problem "Find an antiderivative.\n\n$$\n\\int 3 \\sin{\\left(2 - 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\n{{answer}} $+C$"] [:db/add "7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 - 3 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-3.\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int 3 \\sin{\\left(2 - 3 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate with respect to $u$:\n\n$$\n-\\left(\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)=\\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C.\n$$\n\nSubstitute back:\n\n$$\n\\cos{\\left(2 - 3 x \\right)}+C.\n$$"] [:db/add "7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c" :question/answer-fields "80e6fd79-df4f-5e2f-b1d0-c8b8ac7c8d51"] [:db/ensure "7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "7c02193f-338d-5ea4-8f7d-c922830d530c"] [:db/add "a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f" :answer/id #uuid "a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f"] [:db/add "a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f" :answer/value "1"] [:db/ensure "a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741" :answer-field/id #uuid "aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741"] [:db/add "aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741" :answer-field/choices "a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f"] [:db/add "aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741" :answer-field/correct "a51af6db-9344-5ef0-81f9-25a39a63aa6f"] [:db/ensure "aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279" :question/id #uuid "14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279"] [:db/add "14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} 4 \\cos{\\left(- 4 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\sin{\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}=1,\\quad \\sin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=- 4 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2}$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{8}} 4 \\cos{\\left(- 4 x + \\frac{\\pi}{2} \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=-\\left(\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{0} \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[- \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}^{0}=\\left(0\\right)-\\left(-1\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n1.\n$$"] [:db/add "14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279" :question/answer-fields "aec93d34-d853-521e-9b50-c9c26acbc741"] [:db/ensure "14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "14a4bdf4-8ea4-51a6-81da-5304f43e7279"] [:db/add "5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e" :answer/id #uuid "5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e"] [:db/add "5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}"] [:db/ensure "5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849" :answer-field/id #uuid "7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849"] [:db/add "7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849" :answer-field/choices "5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e"] [:db/add "7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849" :answer-field/correct "5d59fc83-7aa0-595d-aed1-8be7cb662f5e"] [:db/ensure "7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273" :question/id #uuid "ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273"] [:db/add "ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\sin{\\left(\\pi - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=- \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\cos{\\left(\\pi \\right)}=-1,\\quad \\cos{\\left(0 \\right)}=1$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\pi - 4 x$. Then\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}x}=-4.\n$$\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=\\pi\\\\x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe new bounds decrease. Keep this order when evaluating the antiderivative.\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{4}} \\sin{\\left(\\pi - 4 x \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=- \\frac{1}{4}\\left(\\int_{\\pi}^{0} \\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIntegrate and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\frac{\\cos{\\left(u \\right)}}{4}\\right]_{\\pi}^{0}=\\left(\\frac{1}{4}\\right)-\\left(- \\frac{1}{4}\\right).\n$$\n\nThe answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] [:db/add "ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273" :question/answer-fields "7f4984fe-084f-51a5-bb0d-e7dc322c9849"] [:db/ensure "ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068915 :knowledge-point/questions "ee47bd77-b3fc-5c96-b3c1-1120ca3a9273"] [:db/add "a8bb3a90-6824-5d37-96be-dd04dbd40003" :answer/id #uuid "a8bb3a90-6824-5d37-96b